  "aboutIntroHeading": "About Smart Heritage",
  "aboutIntroBody": "Smart Heritage is a visitor guide for museums and heritage sites. It tells the story of each artifact through photos, articles and audio narration, so you can explore at your own pace without waiting for a tour guide.\n\nWhen you approach an artifact fitted with an iBeacon, the app recognises it, opens its introduction and plays the narration right there. All content is written and kept up to date by the site's management team.",
